  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "gt_note_title",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          -1780,
          -1640
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "# Goto & From: the invisible wire\n\n**Four tables, three branches \u2014 and the canvas stays readable because links carry the data across it.**\n\nEvery branch needs the same prep, but nothing redraws it and no wires cross the page:\n\n- **Sources & prep** builds two shared products \u2014 *Orders with revenue* (cleaned orders plus a revenue column) and *Enriched orders* (those same orders joined to their customer segment) \u2014 and hands them, plus *Products* and *Regional targets*, to **Goto** nodes that name them.\n- **Regional performance**, **Product mix** and **Data quality** reach back for what they need with **From** nodes. A From is a Goto's destination end; the run treats a link exactly like a wire, so edit the sources and all three branches re-run.\n\nPress **F5**, then open the **Report** page. To see what this saves you, imagine every From drawn as a wire \u2014 the canvas becomes a crosshatch.",
          "width": 620
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      },
      {
        "id": "gt_note_links",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          480,
          -1640
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "**Links, not wires**\n\nEach From here reads the Goto named on its card \u2014 *Enriched orders*, *Regional targets*, *Orders with revenue*, *Products*. Rename a Goto and its Froms follow; two Froms may read the same Goto. Select a Goto to see which Froms it feeds.",
          "width": 380
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      },
      {
        "id": "gt_orders",
        "type": "flograph.io.table",
        "pos": [
          -1720,
          -860
        ],
        "params": {
          "data": "{\"columns\": [\"order_id\", \"date\", \"region\", \"customer_id\", \"product_id\", \"units\", \"unit_price\"], \"rows\": [[1001, \"Mon\", \"North\", 1, 101, 2, 1200], [1002, \"Mon\", \"North\", 2, 103, 3, 350], [1003, \"Mon\", \"East\", 1, 105, 1, 220], [1004, \"Tue\", \"East\", 3, 101, 1, 1200], [1005, \"Tue\", \"South\", 4, 104, 2, 450], [1006, \"Tue\", \"South\", 2, 106, 4, 90], [1007, \"Wed\", \"West\", 5, 102, 2, 800], [1008, \"Wed\", \"West\", 3, 107, 5, 150], [1009, \"Thu\", \"North\", 4, 108, 6, 40], [1010, \"Fri\", \"North\", 5, 105, 3, 220], [1011, \"Sat\", \"North\", 1, 106, 0, 90]]}",
          "width": 360,
          "height": 220
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "Orders"
      },
      {
        "id": "gt_customers",
        "type": "flograph.io.table",
        "pos": [
          -1720,
          -610
        ],
        "params": {
          "data": "{\"columns\": [\"customer_id\", \"name\", \"segment\"], \"rows\": [[1, \"Acme Co\", \"Enterprise\"], [2, \"Globex\", \"SMB\"], [3, \"Initech\", \"Enterprise\"], [4, \"Umbrella\", \"SMB\"], [5, \"Soylent\", \"Consumer\"]]}",
          "width": 300,
          "height": 160
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "Customers"
      },
      {
        "id": "gt_products",
        "type": "flograph.io.table",
        "pos": [
          -1720,
          -360
        ],
        "params": {
          "data": "{\"columns\": [\"product_id\", \"product\", \"category\"], \"rows\": [[101, \"Laptop\", \"Electronics\"], [102, \"Phone\", \"Electronics\"], [103, \"Monitor\", \"Electronics\"], [104, \"Desk\", \"Furniture\"], [105, \"Chair\", \"Furniture\"], [106, \"Lamp\", \"Furniture\"], [107, \"Headset\", \"Accessories\"], [108, \"Cable Kit\", \"Accessories\"]]}",
          "width": 300,
          "height": 160
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "Products"
      },
      {
